    "body": "## Problem\n\nDescribe the problem (concisely).\n\n## Steps to reproduce\n\n```\nnvim --clean README.md +'se conceallevel=2'\n```\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9a7539cd-9652-4fac-8623-73eb7bd26e40\n\n## Expected behavior\nAll cursor should be display in correct place.\n\n## System info\n\n- Nvim version (nvim -v): `v0.13.0-dev-1600 g4cad27fbcf` neovim/neovim@4cad27fbcf\n- Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?: ?\n- Operating system/version: Linux 7.1.8-zen1-3-zen\n- Terminal name/version: kitty\n- $TERM environment variable: `xterm-kitty`\n- Installation: ?\n\n",
